    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The rules are simple: shapes express movement and colors illustrate abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn how to leverage each piece's movement and abilities. Each puzzle is designed to showcase the delightful synergy between them.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594290/extras/7650c95cd294f355390d2eb3b9931969.poster.avif?t=1731942928\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594290/extras/7650c95cd294f355390d2eb3b9931969.webm?t=1731942928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594290/extras/7650c95cd294f355390d2eb3b9931969.mp4?t=1731942928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Move, push and pull the colorful shape filled pieces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Send them into the goal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Remove them all to solve the puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Celebrate!!!</strong> \ud83e\udd73<br> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594290/extras/4750710e311b150b8e201f25b5c91136.poster.avif?t=1731942928\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594290/extras/4750710e311b150b8e201f25b5c91136.webm?t=1731942928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594290/extras/4750710e311b150b8e201f25b5c91136.mp4?t=1731942928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul c